Reads your reviewed CSV
Downloads each PDF from arxiv.org/pdf/{id}.pdf
Waits 3 seconds between downloads (arxiv's polite rate limit — don't skip this or you'll get blocked)
Logs every success and failure to data/download_log.jsonl
Skips already-downloaded papers if you re-run it — safe to interrupt and resume anytime

